      "If another change",
      " landed first, it:\n\n",
      "- rebases and tries",
      " again by itself\n",
      "- stops after the",
      " *same* reason three",
      " times, so read its",
      " message first\n\n",
      "See [just's manual](https://just.systems/man/en/)",
      " for more."
    ]
