    "question": "Where does the push hook come from?",
    "deltas": [
      "`just setup`",
      " installs it",
      " in your worktree.",
      " It runs `just ci`",
      " on what is pushed,",
      " so a push leaves",
      " only when the",
      " checks pass. It is",
      " set in `scripts/tools.py`:\n\n",
      "```python\ndef install",
      "_hooks(root: Path)",
      " -> None:\n    #",
      " git runs the hooks",
      " kept in the repo\n",
      "    hooks = root /",
      " \"scripts\" / \"hooks\"\n",
      "    run([\"git\", \"config\",",
      " \"core.hooksPath\",",
      " str(hooks)], timeout",
      "=30)\n```"
    ]
